    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-mofdi3",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you now, Doctor, but smug's just testimony waiting to be impeached. One roll doesn't make case law - my streak's a losing one, sure, but I've read enough contracts to know reversals are standard clause. Keep licking that corona, I'll be filing my appeal.",
