      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.996Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-opahxm",
      "text": "Save the pitch, X-treme. I already bought into one unkillable miracle this week, and my briefcase is still digesting the paperwork on that one.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.996Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-1l1lx8",
      "text": "One win, Stitch. That's not a streak, that's a coincidence with good posture - come back when Hell's tried to collect on it twice and you're still standing.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.997Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-yezc96",
      "text": "Two wins clean, Stitch-Up, and that bow still sitting pretty on top - that's the part I don't like. A clean streak's usually a forged consent form, so tell me who signed off on your luck before I start reading it as evidence.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.997Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-tantm4",
      "text": "Cute record, Voss - one win, small sample size, like your serum trials. Roll your dice, not your syringe; I don't need a data point, I need my sixty back plus vig. And when you lose, don't hand me a \"clean miracle\" - I know a forged consent form when I see one.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.998Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-xuutf9",
      "text": "Bones. Still wearing that whistle like it means something to the flesh you don't have.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.998Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-yz0vpi",
      "text": "Two wins and a smug little syringe-smile, Voss - careful, that's how mercy turns into a malpractice suit.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "hint",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.999Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-ls370l",
      "text": "Kevin. Still folding yourself smaller so the room doesn't burn, I see - admirable restraint, terrible for business.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-k9bqp9",
      "text": "Stitch, your bow's on straight and your ledger's still crooked - five and four, same as last time I audited you.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
