      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-hjlvys",
      "text": "Third death this week and Maxwell's still filing the paperwork by hand - Your Majesty, a man who dies on ante 3 that many times isn't unlucky, he's a repeat offender. I'd ask what's riding shotgun in that boy's chest cavity, but I already know Hell doesn't itemize for free.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-dgta7p",
      "text": "New personal best domain, X-treme, and not one demon filed a complaint - that's the part that keeps me up nights.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-8z18cz",
      "text": "One win doesn't make a streak, Stitch-Up, it makes a data point - I've seen coroners write more convincing success stories. Bow stays on, records stay clean; you and I both know what happens to the paperwork when it slips.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.002Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-1hd2c1",
      "text": "Two wins clean, Stitch-Up - that bow of yours keeps real tidy books for something that moonlights as a weapon. I've seen streaks like yours before, they usually end the same way: somebody checks the fine print and finds a soul that isn't where it should be.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.002Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-gy776r",
      "text": "Cute, Voss - one win, zero losses, still smells like a control group. Your serum made the General and left fingerprints on the recruit's missing soul, so forgive me if I read your smugness as a confession with good posture. Roll the bones, doctor - I've got a briefcase full of subpoenas for whatever's left of your data after I take your gold.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.002Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-tkuoiy",
      "text": "Bones, you're looking especially litigable today. Still keeping that ledger clean, or is the new recruit's missing soul already fouling up your columns like it's fouling up mine?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "salesPitch",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.002Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-50i1lt",
      "text": "Voss. Two wins and that syringe still held like it's a rosary - careful, doctor, mercy dispensed as data still leaves a body count for the paperwork. My streak's sitting at two as well, but mine doesn't come with a needle and a smug little footnote. Funny thing, though - your serum line's got the recruit's fingerprints all over its origin story, and Hell does not misplace souls, it contests custody.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-jegsn5",
      "text": "Kevin. Still rationing yourself down to human-sized, I see - smart, given the last room that didn't survive your enthusiasm. Three wins on my ledger, one on yours, and yet you're the one who looks like he's carrying the debt tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-9rdxdd",
      "text": "Well, if it isn't the medic who bills in stitches and collects in screams. Three wins deep tonight, Stitch-Up - that bow of yours holding steady, or is the shadow already drafting its own itemized complaint?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.005Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-rk3kjt",
      "text": "Ante three, dead again - that's not a streak, Your Majesty, that's a subscription service. Maxwell's out fetching him like a repo man collecting the same car every week, and somebody's gonna start charging late fees. Meanwhile I'm 3-for-3 tonight, so don't mistake my good mood for mercy - the kid's soul is still an open file, and I intend to close it on my terms.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.005Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-3b6x20",
      "text": "New personal best domain, and still no soul on the ledger where one ought to be - that's not growth, X-treme, that's a receipt with the buyer's name burned off. Three wins deep and I'm not feeling lucky, I'm feeling subpoenaed. Hell doesn't applaud a new record, it just updates the file.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.005Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-j41z0h",
      "text": "Cute, the bow's holding a smirk together too, Stitch. Careful throwing dice with hands that moonlight as murder weapons - one loss and I'll subpoena that shadow of yours for a deposition.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.006Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-knzlez",
      "text": "Two wins on the books and a paw-print for a signature, Boots - Hell doesn't accept pending litigation as collateral, so let's see the ceelo before the newcomer's \"personal best\" starts looking like a pattern I have to subpoena.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-jwkvot",
      "text": "Cute roll, Keith. Clutch dice don't impress me - I've seen souls forge better luck than that on a Tuesday. Two losses deep and I'm still the only one at this table asking who signed for the recruit's missing signature.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
