        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-r0t46",
      "text": "Personal best domain, sure - but a domain's just real estate until somebody files the deed. Newcomer keeps posting numbers like that, Hell's gonna want a zoning hearing. And zoning hearings, Keith, are where souls get seized as unpaid taxes.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-d9hfit",
      "text": "Three-and-five and you're smug, Bones? That's not a streak, that's a pattern of default. Rattle those dice before I subpoena the whistle.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0012.md",
        "extractedDay": 12,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.008Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-1svgr5",
      "text": "Two wins running, Your Majesty - Hell's ledger's got me penciled in as a small but growing liability. Must be nice up there, undefeated and unbothered, sun on your bones and nobody serving you papers.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-4to9ca",
      "text": "Bones, you keep that ledger cleaner than your own metacarpals, but 4 and 5 says the dice don't read your paperwork. I'm one loss deep and still better odds than whatever you're calling a winning streak - so rattle up, skeleton, let's see if the house always wins or just always lies.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0014.md",
        "extractedDay": 14,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-wplxkh",
      "text": "Cute roll, Voss. Clutch dice don't erase a chain of custody, they just make the forged consent form look prettier. Six and five means you lose more than you admit, so smile smaller.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.010Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-vdgvcv",
      "text": "Boo G, three and six ain't a record, it's a confession. Roll the bones before your own luck files a restraining order against you.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0016.md",
        "extractedDay": 16,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.011Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-be71lp",
      "text": "Careful, Maxwell. A 4-and-5 record from a man who reads for a living, and still can't read the dice. Sit down, lick the King's boots later, I've got a briefcase full of debt collectors who'd love your signature.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0017.md",
        "extractedDay": 17,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.011Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-qr9146",
      "text": "Three losses, Boots, and you're sitting there licking cream off your whiskers like you signed the contract yourself. Five and three, real cute record for something that doesn't even ante up. Laugh it up, cat, the house always loses eventually, and I've got a briefcase full of collections agents with your name on the docket.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0020.md",
        "extractedDay": 20,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-jnp547",
      "text": "Kid dies again, gets up again, and you smile like you signed the receipt yourself, General. Six and five is a losing record dressed up in a nice coat. Watch him bounce back from that flatline before you start smirking at my streak.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0020.md",
        "extractedDay": 20,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-jgr3ob",
      "text": "Cute roll, Bones. Whistle-blowing skeletons still bleed gold on a bad die, and I've got a briefcase that collects on both.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-stzub3",
      "text": "Doctor. Still smells like scorched vellum and servitude down here. Tell me, does His Majesty tip you in gold or just let you keep your kneecaps?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-4i7z5x",
      "text": "Two losses don't scare me, Voss. Your 9 and 9 says the serum's got a fifty-fifty custody record too, so let's not pretend you're holding a full house. Roll the bones and let's see whose data bleeds first.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-9pgnkn",
      "text": "Three losses, Maxwell, and the dice are still lying to my face. You lick that king's boots for a living, so tell me, does he ever fix a game for you, or do you eat the loss like the rest of us mortals with expired paperwork.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        }
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0023.md",
        "extractedDay": 23,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-ff4kdu",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you, Willy, almost as good as it'll look on my briefcase after I take your gold. Roll the bones and quit rehearsing your victory speech, one eye can't even read the dice right half the time.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-qc56nd",
      "text": "A full run and he still didn't cash out his soul, Stitch-Up. Somebody upstairs or downstairs is holding paper on that boy, and I want to see the signature.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-clausen-j5hz68",
      "text": "One eye and you still can't read the table, Willy. Sixteen and twelve looks cute till you remember half those wins were against a rookie who can't die and doesn't know the rules yet. Roll the bones, cyclops, my streak ends tonight and it ends on your gold.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "clausen",
        "name": "Detective Clausen",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
